        "reviewBody": "Separate ghettos for blacks, coloured, whites \u2014 one road in/out, easy to bomb. Non-whites allowed into town to work. Laws against interracial relationships. Cab driver didn't want to hit a 'white' child \u2014 mixed-race people treated better. As mixed you eventually have to choose a side. Coloureds don't know who they are, black folk do. The black tax \u2014 success means supporting family. Chinese/Japanese recategorisation. Hair pencil test. Hitler a common name \u2014 lack of South African education on the Third Reich; Hitler not seen as the most evil from their perspective. Pooh demon story. Cat on football pitch story. Deaf dog story. Black people \u2014 dogs don't play fetch. Black people, no Santa."
      },
